{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 52, :comments ["<b>אשר</b> — the meaning is that those who reproach are the enemies of HaShem." "<b>And the meaning of עקבות משיחך</b> — from the root of בעקב עשו and עקבותיך לא נודעו. And the sense is that his footsteps have been delayed in coming, as one says, his heels are broken; therefore he has not come now."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 89, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:36:42.231906222Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}